<reference id="HTML5-BACnetScheduleImportManager-6932058D" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">HTML5 - BACnet Schedule Import Manager</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">In <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/niagara" class="- topic/keyword "/>, there is added browser support for the BACnet
